Things have not gone to plan; but we have one last gamble. The Chinese cannot see what we are doing on Ganymede as long as they are on Elysium, so we believe that, given long enough, they will send engineers to reprogram the portal so that they can use it from within their base again. If we are right, you will need to contain any other Chinese units emerging from the portal until the engineers arrive - once they have reprogrammed the portal, you are to take command of their vehicle and use it to gain entrance to their base, infiltrating them from the core.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Contain all units emerging from the portal.
- Seize any Chinese engineering units.